OL,3,GNEWSAEnergy firm unveils new slimline
OL,4,Apylons designed 'with Welsh landscape
OL,5,Ain mind' after backlash
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn energy firm facing backlash over
OL,8,Fplans for new power lines has unveiled
OL,9,Fwhat it has described as a "slim and
OL,10,Fcompact" pylon, designed "with the
OL,11,FWelsh landscape in mind".
OL,13,FGreen Gen Cymru said the 22m (72ft)
OL,14,Fhigh single-pole structure was
OL,15,Fconsiderably shorter than traditional
OL,16,Fsteel pylons, with the aim of "limiting
OL,17,Fvisual impact".
OL,19,FThe firm's design has been commissioned
OL,20,Ffor use on two of its three planned
OL,21,Froutes for upgrading the electricity
OL,22,Fgrid across mid and west Wales.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
